  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Who is the youngest goalscorer in Premier League history?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "red",
        "scale": 1.3,
        "person": false,
        "shirt": [
          "#d7192d",
          "#ffffff",
          "DOWMAN",
          ""
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "For a while, it was Wayne Rooney. Sixteen years and three hundred and sixty days old.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "blue",
        "person": {
          "image": "rooney",
          "hairStyle": "short"
        },
        "name": "WAYNE ROONEY · 2002"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then, in 2005, another Everton teenager beat it. James Vaughan.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "blue",
        "person": {
          "image": "vaughan",
          "hairStyle": "short"
        },
        "name": "JAMES VAUGHAN · 2005"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sixteen years, two hundred and seventy days.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "ages",
        "bg": "blue",
        "title": "YOUNGEST SCORER",
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "Rooney · 2002",
            "age": "16y 360d",
            "days": 6200
          },
          {
            "name": "Vaughan · 2005",
            "age": "16y 270d",
            "days": 6110,
            "col": "#ffd84a"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That record lasted twenty-one years.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "years",
        "bg": "purple",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "2005",
            "top": "RECORD",
            "label": "James Vaughan"
          },
          {
            "year": "2026",
            "top": "BROKEN",
            "label": "?",
            "cross": false,
            "tick": true,
            "head": "#1ea85a"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Until March 2026, when Arsenal brought on Max Dowman.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "red",
        "person": false,
        "name": "MAX DOWMAN",
        "shirt": [
          "#d7192d",
          "#ffffff",
          "DOWMAN",
          ""
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "He scored in stoppage time, aged sixteen years and seventy-three days.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "ages",
        "bg": "red",
        "title": "YOUNGEST SCORER",
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "Rooney · 2002",
            "age": "16y 360d",
            "days": 6200
          },
          {
            "name": "Vaughan · 2005",
            "age": "16y 270d",
            "days": 6110
          },
          {
            "name": "Dowman · 2026",
            "age": "16y 73d",
            "days": 5913,
            "col": "#ffd84a"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a hundred and ninety-seven days younger than Vaughan.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "counter",
        "bg": "red",
        "from": 0,
        "to": 197,
        "word": "DAYS YOUNGER",
        "size": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And who did he score against? Everton. The club of both old record holders.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "fixture",
        "bg": "blue",
        "then": {
          "top": "THE OLD RECORDS",
          "score": "ROONEY · VAUGHAN",
          "foot": "BOTH EVERTON"
        },
        "now": {
          "top": "14 MARCH 2026",
          "teams": "ARSENAL 2-0 EVERTON",
          "foot": "DOWMAN · 16Y 73D"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Two months later, he was a Premier League champion, too.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "shelf",
        "bg": "red",
        "title": "AGED 16",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Premier League",
            "year": "2026",
